Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi. This is Synapse — a learning system that\Npredicts what you're about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,to forget, before you forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.52,0:00:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In the future of work, people are always\Nlearning:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.59,0:00:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,new tools, new courses, new certifications.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.64,0:00:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The hard part isn't finding material.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's knowing what still sticks — and what\Nis quietly slipping away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.77,0:00:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,before the next deadline or the next shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.53,0:00:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,On the landing page, you can already see\Nthe idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.11,0:00:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Synapse turns your own notes into a living\Nconcept map.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Each concept is coloured by predicted retention,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.25,0:00:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and outlined by how well you understood it\Non a quiz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.22,0:00:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Memory and understanding stay separate, so\Nyou never confuse I saw this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.56,0:00:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,recently with I actually get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.75,0:00:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sign in with a demo account so you can\Nsee a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,real workspace in dark mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the home map.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.15,0:00:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Two course hubs branch into concepts —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.77,0:00:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,nineteen concepts across two courses in this\Ndemo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.77,0:00:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Green means fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.89,0:00:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Red means fading.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.01,0:00:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Eleven of these are already below fifty percent\Nretention.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.38,0:01:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The outline around each node is quiz confidence:\Nnot assessed, low, medium, or high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.62,0:01:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,When two courses share an idea, Synapse draws\Na cross-course link.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.73,0:01:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What you learn in one place can strengthen\Nanother —
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.47,0:01:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,the way skills compound on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.12,0:01:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,On the right, Review next surfaces the most\Nurgent concepts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.05,0:01:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Alpha-Beta Pruning is at about twenty percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.82,0:01:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Overfitting and Regularization at twenty-nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.80,0:01:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Backpropagation is at zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.38,0:01:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Click one to open a short explanation and\Nreview it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.34,0:01:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Retention jumps back up, and the next fade\Nslows.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.90,0:01:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the spacing effect, fitted to your\Nown review history —
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.65,0:01:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,not a generic flashcard schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.65,0:01:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Upload a course from PDFs, images, or text —
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.05,0:01:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,including photographed handwriting — up to\Nfive files.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.10,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Name the course, optionally tag a semester,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.77,0:01:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and Synapse extracts the concepts and builds\Nthe map for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.99,0:01:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The Guide ranks every concept weakest first,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.75,0:01:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,with retention percentages, confidence, recency,\Nexplanations, study resources,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.94,0:01:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and industry skills per course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.94,0:02:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So your next hour of work goes where it matters\Nmost —
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,whether you're a student, a trainee, or someone\Nreskilling for a new
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.93,0:02:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,For the future of work, continuous learning\Nis the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.53,0:02:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Synapse doesn't ask people to reread everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.06,0:02:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It shows what is about to fade — so skills\Nstay sharp without burnout.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.14,0:02:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Synapse. Know what you'll forget before\Nyou forget it.
